":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"郤縠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001757","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"郤臻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001758","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"狐毛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001739","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"欒枝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"荀林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001760","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"魏犫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001761","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p067","text":"五年春，晉文公欲伐曹，假道於衞，衞人弗許。還自河南度，侵曹，伐衞。正月，取五鹿。二月，晉侯、齊侯盟于斂盂。衞侯請盟晉，晉人不許。衞侯欲與楚，國人不欲，故出其君以説晉。衞侯居襄牛，公子買守衞。楚救衞，不卒。晉侯圍曹。三月丙午，晉師入曹，數之以其不用釐負羈言，而用美女乘軒者三百人也。令軍毋入僖負羈宗家以報德。楚圍宋，宋復告急晉。文公欲救則攻楚，爲楚嘗有德，不欲伐也；欲釋宋，宋又嘗有德於晉：患之。先軫曰：「執曹伯，分曹、衞地以與宋，楚急曹、衞，其勢宜釋宋。」於是文公從之，而楚成王乃引兵歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"齊侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001564","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001564","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001564","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0089","start":89,"end":92,"surface":"公子買","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0123","start":123,"end":126,"surface":"釐負羈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001434","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0130","start":130,"end":138,"surface":"美女乘軒者三百人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0144","start":144,"end":147,"surface":"僖負羈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001434","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"曹伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001433","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0230","start":230,"end":232,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p068","text":"楚將子玉曰：「王遇晉至厚，今知楚急曹、衞而故伐之，是輕王。」王曰：「晉侯亡在外十九年，困日久矣，果得反國，險阸盡知之，能用其民，天之所開，不可當。」子玉請曰：「非敢必有功，願以閒執讒慝之口也。」楚王怒，少與之兵。於是子玉使宛春告晉：「請復衞侯而封曹，臣亦釋宋。」咎犯曰：「子玉無禮矣，君取一，臣取二，勿許。」先軫曰：「定人之謂禮。楚一言定三國，子一言而亡之，我則毋禮。不許楚，是棄宋也。不如私許曹、衞以誘之，執宛春以怒楚，旣戰而後圖之。」晉侯乃囚宛春於衞，且私許復曹、衞。曹、衞告絶於楚。楚得臣怒，撃晉師，晉師退。軍吏曰：「爲何退？」文公曰：「昔在楚，約退三舍，可倍乎！」楚師欲去，得臣不肯。四月戊辰，宋公、齊將、秦將與晉侯次城濮。己巳，與楚兵合戰，楚兵敗，得臣收餘兵去。甲午，晉師還至衡雍，作王宮于踐土。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"楚將子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"楚王","