":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0301","start":301,"end":303,"surface":"宋公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0304","start":304,"end":306,"surface":"齊將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0307","start":307,"end":309,"surface":"秦將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0310","start":310,"end":312,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0329","start":329,"end":331,"surface":"得臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p072","text":"六月，晉人復入衞侯。壬午，晉侯度河北歸國。行賞，狐偃爲首。或曰：「城濮之事，先軫之謀。」文公曰：「城濮之事，偃説我毋失信。先軫曰『軍事勝爲右』，吾用之以勝。然此一時之説，偃言萬世之功，柰何以一時之利而加萬世功乎？是以先之。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001564","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p079","text":"晉先軫曰：「秦伯不用蹇叔，反其衆心，此可撃。」欒枝曰：「未報先君施於秦，撃之，不可。」先軫曰：「秦侮吾孤，伐吾同姓，何德之報？」遂撃之。襄公墨衰絰。四月，敗秦師于殽，虜秦三將孟明視、西乞秫、白乙丙以歸。遂墨以葬文公。文公夫人秦女，謂襄公曰：「秦欲得其三將戮之。」公許，遣之。先軫聞之，謂襄公曰：「患生矣。」軫乃追秦將。秦將渡河，已在船中，頓首謝，卒不反。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"秦伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"蹇叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000377","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"欒枝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"秦三將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0087","start":87,"end":90,"surface":"孟明視","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000392","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0